WEBVTT

00:03:00.579 --> 00:03:04.413
The current pandemic has compounded that
disturbance on a massive scale.

00:03:04.788 --> 00:03:07.413
In the face of uncertainty,
we often freeze up.

00:03:07.996 --> 00:03:10.496
Researchers call it a threat, rigidity,
response.

00:03:11.246 --> 00:03:13.871
When we feel powerless to counter
the threats around us,

00:03:13.871 --> 00:03:15.496
our thinking becomes constrained.

00:03:15.996 --> 00:03:19.871
We hang on for dear life, stop taking
risks and play it safe.

00:03:20.621 --> 00:03:23.746
The past year has left us all
reacting to dramatic change.

00:03:24.371 --> 00:03:26.871
But psychologists find that when
we encounter turbulence,

00:03:27.079 --> 00:03:29.288
instead of pushing harder
against the headwinds,

00:03:29.621 --> 00:03:33.163
we're generally better off tilting our
rudder and charting a new course.